<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - A.H. Belo rated buy. [CORRECTED 15:20 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - A.H. Belo rated buy. [CORRECTED 15:20 GMT]</headline>
<text>
<p>-- JP Morgan said analyst Matthew Corrigan initiated coverage of A.H. Belo Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $2.06 per share for 1996 and $2.49 for 1997, versus $1.68 for 1995.</p>
<p>-- said company is well managed and well capitalized and &quot;enjoys the best equilibrium between broadcasting and newspapers of any hybrid TV/newspaper company.&quot;</p>
<p>-- set price targets of $48 for 1997 and $58 for 1998</p>
<p>(Corrects from $58 for 1996.)</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1/8 to 40-1/2.</p>
</text>
